### 4. Existing tests related to capacity / owner creation

- `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/test/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/acceptance/AcceptanceTest.java` — the sole capacity-warning test:
  - `coreWarnsWhenApproachingCapacity()`: fills a fresh city to 40 owners, creates one more, then asserts `GET /api/owners/{id}` returns `$.capacityWarning == true`. The doc comment states: "`capacityWarning` is true when the owner's city already holds 40-49 owners (approaching the 50 hard limit)."
